      Locale files derived from the Copenhagen theme.
  * settings/**
      Default images and the injectable file defaults.

Modifications made by Aarhus:
  * manifest.json
      Renamed the theme to "Aarhus", rebranded the palette and typography
      defaults, and kept the logout_url, inject_script and inject_style
      settings.
  * templates/document_head.hbs
      Exposes the palette to the Zendesk rich text editor through
      data-hc-color-scheme and --hc-primary-color, and loads the generated
      import map.
  * templates/header.hbs
      The sign-out link honours the logout_url setting, falling back to the
      stock behaviour when the setting is empty.
  * styles/
      Aarhus palette and design tokens, plus a reset that replaces the archived
      normalize.css.
  * src/
      React 18 roots (createRoot), styled-components 6 transient props,
      i18next 27 / react-i18next 18, @zendesk/help-center-wysiwyg 2, and the
      aarhus-theme-* translation key namespace.
  * translations/**
      The module translation keys were renamed from cph-theme-* to
      aarhus-theme-*.
  * build/
      Rewritten build helpers: the Sass settings preamble and the import map
      generator.
  * settings/
      Regenerated brand artwork (logo, favicon, backgrounds and hero image).

